# ==============================================================================
# THE TEMPLATE PACK - ITS GMAKE TARGETS
# ==============================================================================
# Every *.mk here is loaded by the instance's gmake as soon as the pack's
# folder is in ~/.config/packs - targets, variables, whatever a pack brings.
# `gmake help` lists the targets that carry a `## ` comment; the cheatsheet
# check reads the same comments.
#
# The template brings no target. One looks like this:
#
# ## say hello
# hello:
# 	@echo "hello"
